      185.13,
      201.67,
      378.57,
      227.37
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA SEMATA SETHAFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      238.63,
      402.05,
      313.41
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS AS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cSri Lanka Semata Setha Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.67,
      402.15,
      387.21
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      398.47,
      402.31,
      424.17
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      435.43,
      401.82,
      461.01
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Semata SethaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      472.27,
      402.0,
      596.37
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cSri Lanka Semata Setha Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admittedmembers of the Corporation hereby constituted shall be abody corporate, (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d)with perpetual succession under the name and style of \u201cSriLanka Semata Setha Foundation\u201d and by that name may sueand be sued in all courts, with full power and authority tohave and use a common seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      607.63,
      402.01,
      633.21
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.61,
      644.47,
      402.0,
      670.17
    ],
    "text": "(a)improving the economical standards of the poorfamilies living within Sri Lanka ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      474.02,
      455.81,
      523.09
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof the SriLankaSemata SethaFoundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
