  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.63,
      249.55,
      397.36,
      286.89
    ],
    "text": "(c)supporting the activities to eliminate poverty ofthese families by improving their financialstandards;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      168.91,
      297.55,
      396.95,
      322.89
    ],
    "text": "(d)supporting the activities of protection of theenvironment in Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.63,
      333.55,
      397.3,
      358.89
    ],
    "text": "(e)supporting the activities of nutritionalrehabilitation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.19,
      369.55,
      397.45,
      418.89
    ],
    "text": "(f)joining in collaborative activities with otherorganizations, religious and cultural institutionswhich Foundation the deems necessary to corporatewith ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
