  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.91,
      429.55,
      397.28,
      478.89
    ],
    "text": "(g)assist in the provision of books, instruments,clothing, loans and other financial assistance tochildren in lower income families which needassistance;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.91,
      489.55,
      397.0,
      514.89
    ],
    "text": "(h)to establish a fund and regularize same in order toachieve the above mentioned objectives.; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.19,
      525.55,
      397.36,
      562.89
    ],
    "text": "(i)to do all other things necessary or expedient for theproper and effective carrying out of the objects ofthe Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      573.55,
      397.49,
      598.89
    ],
    "text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act, and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      609.55,
      397.36,
      670.89
    ],
    "text": "(a) acquire, hold or take any immovable property forthe corporation or give on lease or hire, mortgage,pledge, sell, exchange or otherwise alienate,encumber or dispose of any immovable property ofthe Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      575.3,
      451.16,
      595.57
    ],
    "text": "Powers of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
