      273.55,
      401.99,
      298.89
    ],
    "text": "(c) accept gifts, donations and bequests in cash or inkind;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      309.55,
      402.19,
      358.89
    ],
    "text": "(d) advance or lend and to borrow money for thepurposes of the Corporation in such a mannerand upon such security as the Corporation maythink fit;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      369.55,
      402.04,
      394.89
    ],
    "text": "(e) invest its funds, create and administer Trusts and tomaintain current, and savings accounts in any bank;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      182.85,
      405.55,
      401.9,
      454.89
    ],
    "text": "(f) publish or cause to be published books, journals,magazines and other literature and establishand maintain libraries, book shops and prinitingpresses;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      465.55,
      402.08,
      526.89
    ],
    "text": "(g) appoint, employ, transfer, exercise disciplinarycontrol over officers and servants required for thecarrying out of the objects of the Corporation andto prescribe their terms and conditions of serviceand dismiss such officer; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      537.55,
      401.9,
      574.89
    ],
    "text": "(h) generally do all such other acts and things as arenecessary for and incidental or conducive to thecarrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      585.55,
      402.26,
      670.89
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subjects tothe rules of the Corporation, to be made under section 6 ofthis Act be administered by a Board of Management(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d) consisting of theChairman, the Vice Chairman, the Secretary, AssistantSecretary, the Treasurer and nine other members elected orappointed in accordance with the rules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      633.07,
      155.01,
      646.41
    ],
    "text": "30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      587.54,
      453.58,
      627.01
    ],
